{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22037","headline":"有木诗八首 八 · 白居易","name":"有木诗八首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有木名丹桂，四时香馥馥。\n花团夜雪明，叶翦春云绿。\n风影清似水，霜枝冷如玉。\n独占小山幽，不容凡鸟宿。\n匠人爱芳直，裁截爲厦屋。\n干细力未成，用之君自速。\n重任虽大过，直心终不曲。\n纵非梁栋材，犹胜寻常木。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22037.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22037","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}